meta {
  name: Get URLs
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/urls?limit=1000&offset=0&~searchText=&~state=&orderBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc&~isFile=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  limit: 1000
  offset: 0
  ~searchText:
  ~state: ACTIVE
  orderBy: createdAt
  sortDirection: desc
  ~isFile: true
}

docs {
  Get a paginated list of short URLs.

  Query params:
  - `limit` (number, default 1000)
  - `offset` (number, default 0)
  - `searchText` (string, optional)
  - `state` (enum: ACTIVE, INACTIVE, optional)
  - `orderBy` (enum: createdAt, clicks; default createdAt)
  - `sortDirection` (enum: desc, asc; default desc)
  - `isFile` (boolean, optional)

  Response:
  ```json
  {
    "urls": [{
      "shortUrl": "197abc",
      "longUrl": "https://link.com",
      "state": "ACTIVE",
      "clicks": 0,
      "createdAt": "2022-09-19T03:31:00.131Z",
      "updatedAt": "2022-09-19T03:31:00.131Z"
    }],
    "count": 1
  }
  ```
}
